<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="schedule" label="schedule">
  <title>Schedule</title>
  <p>
    In the Homework column, the problems listed after <q>Present</q> are the presentation problems for the next class meeting, and those marked with an asterisk are Tier 2 problems for the <xref ref="portfolio" text="title"/>.
  </p>
  <p component="graduate">
    The problems listed after <q>Graduate, present</q> are the presentation problems for graduate students, who present these problems in place of those listed after <q>Present</q>.
  </p>
